      "titre": {
        "_type": "localeString",
        "en": "Where is the Aube?",
        "fr": "Situer l'Aube",
        "it": "Dove si trova l'Aube",
        "nl": "Waar ligt de Aube?"
      }
    },
    {
      "_key": "tgh",
      "_type": "blocTexte",
      "image": {
        "_type": "imageAvecAlt",
        "alt": {
          "_type": "localeString",
          "en": "Champagne vineyard slope in Spoy, in the Côte des Bar, in summer",
          "fr": "Coteau de vignes de Champagne à Spoy, dans la Côte des Bar, en été"
        },
        "asset": {
          "_ref": "image-296528de4e32dfe09c8b82df0de6df214313f8be-1807x2400-jpg",
          "_type": "reference"
        },
        "credit": "© Champagne de l'Aube / Detectezmoi.com"
      },
      "texte": {
        "_type": "localeRichText",
        "en": [
          {
            "_key": "tgl",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "tgk",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "In the Côte des Bar, the vines grow on Kimmeridgian marl and limestone, a layer from the Upper Jurassic also found in Chablis. In Montgueux, the hill is made of Turonian chalk. Two subsoils, two expressions: pinot noir on one side, chardonnay on the other."
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          }
        ],
        "fr": [
          {
            "_key": "tgj",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "tgi",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Dans la Côte des Bar, la vigne pousse sur des marnes et des calcaires du Kimméridgien, une couche du Jurassique supérieur que l'on retrouve aussi à Chablis. À Montgueux, c'est une craie du Turonien qui forme la colline. Deux sous-sols, deux expressions : le pinot noir d'un côté, le chardonnay de l'autre."
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          }
        ],
        "it": [
          {
            "_key": "tgp",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "tgo",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Nella Côte des Bar, la vite cresce su marne e calcari del Kimmeridgiano, uno strato del Giurassico superiore che si ritrova anche a Chablis. A Montgueux la collina è fatta di gesso del Turoniano. Due sottosuoli, due espressioni: il pinot noir da una parte, lo chardonnay dall'altra."
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          }
        ],
        "nl": [
          {
            "_key": "tgn",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "tgm",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "In de Côte des Bar groeien de wijnstokken op mergel en kalksteen uit het Kimmeridgien, een laag uit het Boven-Jura die je ook in Chablis vindt. In Montgueux bestaat de heuvel uit krijt uit het Turonien. Twee ondergronden, twee uitdrukkingen: pinot noir aan de ene kant, chardonnay aan de andere."
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          }
        ]
      },
      "titre": {
        "_type": "localeString",
        "en": "Soils from the Jurassic and the Cretaceous",
        "fr": "Des sols venus du Jurassique et du Crétacé",
        "it": "Suoli del Giurassico e del Cretaceo",
        "nl": "Bodems uit het Jura en het Krijt"
      }
    },
    {
      "_key": "tgq",
      "_type": "blocTexte",
      "image": {
        "_type": "imageAvecAlt",
        "alt": {
          "_type": "localeString",
          "en": "Sunset over the vines and the track, in Merrey-sur-Arce",
          "fr": "Coucher de soleil sur les vignes et le chemin, à Merrey-sur-Arce"
        },
        "asset": {
          "_ref": "image-33c5ab633f5c484cfd64806794c170ef30a4aa5a-1350x2400-jpg",
          "_type": "reference"
        },
        "credit": "© Champagne de l'Aube / Detectezmoi.com"
      },
      "texte": {
        "_type": "localeRichText",
        "en": [
          {
            "_key": "tgu",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "tgt",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Like the whole of Champagne, the Aube lives under two influences. The oceanic one brings regular rainfall and temperatures without sharp contrasts. The continental one brings frosts that can be harsh, but also generous summer sunshine."
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          }
        ],
        "fr": [
          {
            "_key": "tgs",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "tgr",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Comme toute la Champagne, l'Aube vit sous une double influence. Océanique, elle apporte des pluies régulières et des températures sans grands écarts. Continentale, elle amène des gelées parfois rudes, mais aussi un bel ensoleillement en été."
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          }
        ],
        "it": [
          {
            "_key": "tgy",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "tgx",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Come tutta la Champagne, l'Aube vive sotto una doppia influenza. Quella oceanica porta piogge regolari e temperature senza grandi sbalzi. Quella continentale porta gelate a volte rigide, ma anche un bel soleggiamento estivo."
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          }
        ],
        "nl": [
          {
            "_key": "tgw",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "tgv",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Zoals de hele Champagne staat de Aube onder een dubbele invloed. De oceanische brengt regelmatige regen en temperaturen zonder grote verschillen. De continentale brengt soms strenge vorst, maar ook veel zon in de zomer."
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          }
        ]
      },
      "titre": {
        "_type": "localeString",
        "en": "A climate with two influences",
        "fr": "Un climat à double influence",
        "it": "Un clima a doppia influenza",
        "nl": "Een klimaat met twee invloeden"
      }
    },
    {
      "_key": "tgz",
      "_type": "blocTexte",
      "image": {
        "_type": "imageAvecAlt",
        "alt": {
          "_type": "localeString",
          "en": "Cellar pillars engraved with inscriptions in praise of Aube wine",
          "fr": "Piliers de cave gravés d'inscriptions à la gloire du vin de l'Aube"
        },
        "asset": {
          "_ref": "image-99f7eece107943c847d8da4ad9fb9e63cc28d61c-2400x1600-jpg",
          "_type": "reference"
        }
      },
      "texte": {
        "_type": "localeRichText",
        "en": [
          {
            "_key": "th3",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "th2",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "In the early 20th century, the Aube was at first kept out of the Champagne appellation. In 1911, its winemakers mobilised to defend their place. The law of 28 July 1927 brought their vineyard back into Champagne."
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          }
        ],
        "fr": [
          {
            "_key": "th1",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "th0",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Au début du XXe siècle, l'Aube est d'abord tenue à l'écart de l'appellation Champagne. En 1911, ses vignerons se mobilisent pour défendre leur place. La loi du 28 juillet 1927 réintègre leur vignoble dans la Champagne."
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          }
        ],
        "it": [
          {
            "_key": "th7",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "th6",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "All'inizio del Novecento, l'Aube fu dapprima tenuta fuori dalla denominazione Champagne. Nel 1911 i suoi vignaioli si mobilitarono per difendere il loro posto. La legge del 28 luglio 1927 reintegrò il loro vigneto nella Champagne."
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          }
        ],
        "nl": [
          {
            "_key": "th5",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "th4",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Begin 20e eeuw werd de Aube eerst buiten de appellatie Champagne gehouden. In 1911 kwamen de wijnmakers in actie om hun plaats te verdedigen. De wet van 28 juli 1927 bracht hun wijngaard terug in de Champagne."
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          }
        ]
      },
      "titre": {
        "_type": "localeString",
        "en": "A story of winemakers",
        "fr": "Une histoire de vignerons",
        "it": "Una storia di vignaioli",
        "nl": "Een verhaal van wijnmakers"
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
